{"id":8,"course_no":"008","title":"Matplotlib Python 数据可视化","summary":"对于数据科学，Matplotlib 是流行的可视化数据的工具之一。 还有很多其他工具，但对于 Python 用户来说，Matplotlib 是必须知道的。\r\n\r\n在本课程中，我们将学习如何以几种不同的方式直观地表示数据。 你将学习如何使用图形(figure)和轴(axe)来绘制图表，以及如何从多种类型的对象和模块中进行绘图。\r\n\r\n你还将发现控制轴线(spine)的方法以及如何使用 GridSpec 为图形创建复杂的布局，从而创建视觉上令人惊叹的图表。\r\n\r\n在课程的后半部分，我们将专注于如何绘制各种类型的图，无论是线条图、饼图还是热图。 总的来说，这是创建有说服力且实用数据图表的简单介绍。\r\n\r\n学完之后，相信你将拥有一项重要的新技能。 正如任何数据科学家都知道的那样，必须能够从纷繁复杂的数据中发现规律且可视化出来，才能让人信服。","brief_summary":"数据可视化","details":"","cover_img":"/content/assets/05527e8be31f0d655a90.png","mini_cover_img":null,"mobile_cover_img":"/content/assets/05527e8be31f0d655a90.png","intro_video_url":null,"target_audience":"intermediate","work_mode":"","is_mini":false,"is_educative":true,"is_active":true,"course_type":"educative","read_hour":"6","rank":14,"language":"python","mall_cover_img":null,"mall_cover_v2_img":"/content/assets/9cad5da001018017334e.png","learning_points":"test","share_your_gets":"test","share_sub_title":"Matplotlib Python 数据可视化","skills":[],"cates":[4],"toc":{"categories":[{"id":39,"seq_no":0,"title":"介绍","type":"COLLECTION_CATEGORY","icon_url":null,"pages":[{"id":338,"title":"关于本课程","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":true,"coaches":[],"number":"1.1","status":"undo"},{"id":339,"title":"Matplotlib术语","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":true,"coaches":[],"number":"2.1","status":"undo"}],"coaches":[],"learn_info":{"page_num":2,"learn_page_num":0,"coach_num":0,"learn_coach_num":0}},{"id":40,"seq_no":1,"title":"画图元素","type":"COLLECTION_CATEGORY","icon_url":null,"pages":[{"id":340,"title":"尝鲜，绘制第一张图","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":false,"coaches":[],"number":"3.1","status":"undo"},{"id":341,"title":"作图的其他方法","sub_title":"","type":"collection_lesson","edit_mode":false,"is_required":false,"is_preview":false,"coaches":[],"number":"4.1